    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkop naitokini aapuo aaibung aaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netamorua apa Yoshua neaku oloo larin kumok; nejoki Olaitoriani ninye, “Itamorua iyie nitaa oloo larin kumok, neton ake etii enkop sapuk oleng naji pee eyae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena kop ina neton eng'or: nkuapi pooki oo Lfilisti, o nekua pooki oo Lgerushi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(ebaiki Shihor te nkalo e nkilepunoto e nkolong e Misiri, moikuape te nkalo o lpolosie le Ekron, eyioloi ninye aajo enoo Lkanaani; netii ilaitoriak imiet loo Lfilisti, lekua le Gasa, o Ashdod, o Ashkelon, Gati o Ekron), o lekua le Afiim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore te nkalo e kopikop, naa enkop pooki oo Lkanaani, o Meara nara ninye enoo Lsidoni o metabaiki Afek, o metabaiki olpolosie loo Lamori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o enkop oo Lgibali o Lebanon pooki, te nkalo e nkilepunoto e nkolong, ebaiki Baalgad ti abori oldoinyo le Hermon o metabaiki enejing'ieki Hamat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 33.54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ore lelo pooki oomanya ina kop oo ldoinyo ebaiki Lebanon o metabaiki Misrefot-maim, o metabaiki doi ninye Isidoni pooki. Kamiraa nanu makewan aipang'ie te dukuya iltung'ana le Israel; kake tooriki ake duoo iyie ina kop iltung'ana le Israel metaa enjung'ore enye, anaa apa enaaitanapa nanu iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata tooro ena kop metaa enjung'ore too loshon oopishana o lpisiai lo losho le Manase.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eoroto e nkop natii oloo saen lo lkeju le Yordan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 32.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore olikae pisiai lo losho le Manase o le Ruben o le Gad neng'amu enjung'ore enye, apa naishoo ninche Musa, te lido kekun Yordan te nkalo o loosaen, anaa enaishoo ninche Musa osinka lo Laitoriani: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebaiki Aroer aa ninye apa natii olomanaa lo erata le Arnon, o ina anasa natii empolos o erata o ina kop naluaa e Medeba o metabaiki Dibon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o nkanas pooki e Sihon olaiguanani loo Lamori, apa laa ninye oitoreisho te Heshbon, o metabaiki olpolosie loo Lamoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Gilead o nkuapi oo Lgeshuri o Lmaakati, o ldoinyo le Hermon pooki, o Bashan pooki o metabaiki Saleka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enkitoria pooki e Oog te Bashan, laa ninye apa oitoreisho ti atua Ashtarot etii atua Edrei (ninye apake etelekuaki to lpisiai le Refaim); kulo apa etimira Musa nearaa aipang'ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eyia eitu apa earaa iltung'ana le Israel Ilgeshuri aashu Ilmaakati; kake etobiko apa Ilgeshuri o Lmaakati te mpolos e Israel o metabaiki ena olong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
